: "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Unexpectedly outperforms all larger models, including Llama2-70B, at faithful feature attribution specifically for sentiment classification, showing faithfulness is not monotonic with scale."}, {"id": "2401_07927_imdb", "label": "IMDB (sentiment classification)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_babi", "label": "bAbI-1 (multi-choice QA)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_mctest", "label": "MCTest (multi-choice QA)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_rte", "label": "RTE (natural language inference)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_samek_et_al_2017", "label": "Samek et al. 2017", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_hooker_et_al_2019", "label": "Hooker et al. 2019", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_huang_et_al_2023", "label": "Huang et al. 2023 (ChatGPT self-consistency)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Prior attempt failed because ChatGPT's self-reported confidence/importance scores were uncalibrated and it frequently refused to classify with missing information; this paper's discrete-label plus 'unknown' design sidesteps that failure mode."}, {"id": "2401_07927_lanham_et_al_2023", "label": "Lanham et al. 2023 (CoT self-consistency)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reaches a similarly model-and-task-dependent conclusion via a different mechanism (false-fact injection into CoT); authors flag a validity concern that injected facts may look like typos rather than genuinely altering reasoning."}, {"id": "2401_07927_jacovi_goldberg_2020", "label": "Jacovi and Goldberg 2020 (plausibility vs. faithfulness)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_ribeiro_et_al_2016", "label": "Ribeiro et al. 2016", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "26nla_paper", "label": "Natural Language Autoencoder (26nla)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Structurally different route to the same concern (verbalized self-reports of internal state are not automatically accurate): trains a model to translate internal activations into language, validated via activation-reconstruction accuracy rather than behavioral consistency."}, {"id": "2401_07927_paper", "label": "Self-Explanation Faithfulness Study (2401.07927)", "file_type": "paper", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Uses a single-sample, fixed-seed experimental design as an explicit, disclosed cost tradeoff, while testing six prompt-pattern variations specifically to guard against phrasing sensitivity."}, {"id": "2401_07927_faithfulness_model_task_dependence", "label": "Faithfulness is Model/Explanation/Task Dependent", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_falcon_scale_inversion", "label": "Falcon Scale-Inverted Performance", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_counterfactual_imdb_limitation", "label": "Counterfactual Faithfulness Limited to IMDB", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}, {"id": "2401_07927_redaction_feature_attribution_correspondence", "label": "Redaction/Feature-Attribution Result Correspondence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Close correspondence between redaction and feature-attribution results is used as internal evidence that masking-induced distributional shift is not driving feature-attribution findings."}, {"id": "2401_07927_prompt_robustness", "label": "Robustness to Persona/Wording Variation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "2401.07927.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": null}], "edges": [{"source": "2401_07927_pap